  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals minus 3 left parenthesis x minus 18 right parenthesis squared plus 15\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mfenced>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mn>18</mn>\n\t\t\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t\t</mfenced>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">If the given equations are graphed in the <em>xy</em>-plane, at how many points do the graphs of the equations intersect?</p>",
